# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
# docs/ is NOT ignored — committed static shell for GitHub Pages (main /docs).
# docs/games/ is produced by `vite build` from public/games/ and must be committed
# so branch-based Pages deploy includes /games/* (ignored entries are never pushed).
# Tutorial clones sometimes include nested repos — never track
public/games/**/.git/
docs/games/**/.git/
*.local

